## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Flash Lite
- **Short description:** Local metadata describes Qwen 3.5 Flash Lite as an Alibaba Cloud MoE API tier (~35B total/3B active, 1M context, multimodal input) for high-volume low-cost workloads, but this exact model ID/tier could not be independently verified from accessible official/public catalogs, model APIs, or documentation in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Claimed as Alibaba Cloud Model Studio / commercial hosted API tier (`opencode/qwen-3.5-flash-lite`) in local metadata. No verifiable listing found for this exact ID/tier in reviewed Alibaba Cloud model pages, models.dev, OpenRouter, Artificial Analysis, or Hugging Face searches/APIs.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not independently verified for this exact ID/tier. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.5-flash-lite`, `Qwen 3.5 Flash Lite`, `opencode/qwen-3.5-flash-lite` (local metadata claims).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total; 65,536 max output (local metadata claim, unverified).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata claim, unverified).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** ~ $0.10/$0.40 per 1M in/out (local metadata claim, unverified).
- **Architecture:** MoE (~35B total / 3B active) claimed in local metadata; not independently verified from an official model card for this exact tier.

