### Source comparison / conflicts

- **Identity/access:** Local metadata claims `opencode/qwen-3.5-flash-lite` as an Alibaba Cloud commercial tier, but reviewed Alibaba Cloud model pages and public catalogs/APIs did not list this exact ID/tier in this pass.
- **Catalog confusion risk:** “Flash Lite” naming overlaps with other vendors/products (e.g. Gemini 3.5 Flash Lite appeared in searches/APIs); no evidence tied those listings to this exact Qwen model.
- **Specs/benchmarks:** Claimed context, modalities, architecture, and pricing remain unverified; no standardized benchmark evidence found.

